WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.533
We have some brand

00:00:00.533 --> 00:00:02.035
new CNN reporting for you.

00:00:02.035 --> 00:00:03.870
Sources telling CNN that Russia

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:04.771
has been sending

00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:07.474
us weapons that are captured in Ukraine

00:00:07.674 --> 00:00:08.708
to Iran.

00:00:08.708 --> 00:00:10.043
CNN's Natasha Bertrand

00:00:10.043 --> 00:00:12.045
has this reporting Natasha.

00:00:12.078 --> 00:00:13.613
So obviously the U.S.

00:00:13.613 --> 00:00:13.847
has been

00:00:13.847 --> 00:00:15.515
sending a lot of weaponry

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:17.717
to Ukraine since Russia invaded.

00:00:17.751 --> 00:00:18.818
What exactly

00:00:18.818 --> 00:00:21.621
are the Russian forces doing here?

00:00:21.621 --> 00:00:22.088
Yeah, Kaitlin.

00:00:22.088 --> 00:00:22.989
So what we're told

00:00:22.989 --> 00:00:24.391
by four different sources

00:00:24.391 --> 00:00:25.191
is that the Russians

00:00:25.191 --> 00:00:27.060
have been capturing us made U.S.

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:28.728
provided equipment on the battlefield

00:00:28.728 --> 00:00:30.163
in certain instances.

00:00:30.163 --> 00:00:32.332
And sending that equipment to Iran.

00:00:32.365 --> 00:00:34.134
Now, these are smaller items.

00:00:34.134 --> 00:00:35.568
These are things like shoulder

00:00:35.568 --> 00:00:37.270
fired missiles, like Javelin

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:38.438
anti-tank missiles

00:00:38.438 --> 00:00:40.340
and Stinger anti-aircraft systems

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:42.275
and also the NATO's equivalent. Right.

00:00:42.275 --> 00:00:43.543
Because NATO's also providing

00:00:43.543 --> 00:00:44.844
some of the similar equipment.

00:00:44.844 --> 00:00:46.479
So they're they're taking this equipment

00:00:46.479 --> 00:00:47.981
that sometimes the Ukrainians

00:00:47.981 --> 00:00:48.882
are forced to leave

00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:49.983
behind on the battlefield.

00:00:49.983 --> 00:00:51.551
Whether because they are overrun

00:00:51.551 --> 00:00:53.586
or they simply need to withdraw quickly.

00:00:53.586 --> 00:00:55.088
And they are sending that

00:00:55.088 --> 00:00:55.789
that equipment

00:00:55.789 --> 00:00:58.324
in many instances to Iran, likely

00:00:58.324 --> 00:01:00.660
so that Iran can then reverse engineer

00:01:00.927 --> 00:01:01.728
that equipment

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:03.563
so that they can potentially reproduce it

00:01:03.563 --> 00:01:05.098
and make their own kind of version.

00:01:05.098 --> 00:01:06.566
Now, the Russians are doing this

00:01:06.566 --> 00:01:08.401
because they want Iran to continue

00:01:08.401 --> 00:01:10.970
to help them in their war in Ukraine.

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:11.137
Right.

00:01:11.137 --> 00:01:12.272
This is part of the growing

00:01:12.272 --> 00:01:13.206
defense partnership

00:01:13.206 --> 00:01:13.773
that we have seen

00:01:13.773 --> 00:01:15.275
between Iran and Russia.

00:01:15.275 --> 00:01:16.609
And it really has intensified

00:01:16.609 --> 00:01:18.745
over the last year with Iran providing

00:01:18.745 --> 00:01:19.646
hundreds of drones

00:01:19.646 --> 00:01:21.014
to Russia, other equipment,

00:01:21.014 --> 00:01:23.349
and Russia now looking to kind of pay

00:01:23.349 --> 00:01:25.151
that back to Iran by providing them

00:01:25.151 --> 00:01:27.520
with these Western types of equipment

00:01:27.987 --> 00:01:29.222
so that the Iranians

00:01:29.222 --> 00:01:30.590
can basically take them apart

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:31.925
and try to reverse engineer them.

00:01:31.925 --> 00:01:33.660
And have they done this before,

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:35.728
reverse engineer Western weapons?

00:01:36.663 --> 00:01:36.996
Yes.

00:01:36.996 --> 00:01:37.497
The Iranians

00:01:37.497 --> 00:01:39.032
are actually very adept at this.

00:01:39.032 --> 00:01:41.267
One of their top

00:01:41.267 --> 00:01:42.469
weapons in their inventory

00:01:42.469 --> 00:01:44.671
is an anti entity guided missile

00:01:44.971 --> 00:01:47.807
that they actually reproduced from

00:01:47.841 --> 00:01:49.442
an American anti-tank

00:01:49.442 --> 00:01:51.411
missile in the 1970s

00:01:51.411 --> 00:01:52.612
that it really is

00:01:52.612 --> 00:01:54.247
a key part of their inventory now.

00:01:54.247 --> 00:01:56.549
They also were able to reproduce

00:01:56.549 --> 00:01:57.917
an American made drone

00:01:57.917 --> 00:01:59.953
that they intercepted in 2011,

00:02:00.153 --> 00:02:01.588
making their own version of that

00:02:01.588 --> 00:02:03.423
which then crossed into Israeli airspace

00:02:03.423 --> 00:02:05.191
before being shot down in 2018.

00:02:05.191 --> 00:02:07.060
So they have proven very capable

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:07.627
of doing this

00:02:07.627 --> 00:02:08.061
and is one

00:02:08.061 --> 00:02:09.329
expert told me

00:02:09.329 --> 00:02:11.798
that could prove very dangerous to

00:02:12.031 --> 00:02:14.667
of course Israel and other

00:02:14.667 --> 00:02:16.202
allies in the region

00:02:16.202 --> 00:02:16.503
who are

00:02:16.503 --> 00:02:18.071
of course very concerned about the threat

00:02:18.071 --> 00:02:19.806
that Iran already poses. Caitlin.

00:02:19.806 --> 00:02:20.740
Yeah absolutely

00:02:20.740 --> 00:02:21.808
and we're seeing that partnership

00:02:21.808 --> 00:02:23.943
with Iran and Russia getting even closer.

00:02:23.943 --> 00:02:25.879
Natasha Bertrand, great reporting.

00:02:25.879 --> 00:02:26.779
Thank you.

00:02:26.913 --> 00:02:28.481
New this morning, nearly half a million

00:02:28.481 --> 00:02:29.649
people are without power

00:02:29.649 --> 00:02:31.618
in Ukraine's second largest city.

00:02:31.618 --> 00:02:34.053
That's Kharkiv after Moscow launched.

00:02:34.053 --> 00:02:35.388
95 missiles

00:02:35.388 --> 00:02:35.855
over the past

00:02:35.855 --> 00:02:36.723
24 hours, killing

00:02:36.723 --> 00:02:38.958
at least six people in the lead.

00:02:38.958 --> 00:02:40.193
Ukrainian officials say

00:02:40.193 --> 00:02:41.661
Russia has been targeting

00:02:41.661 --> 00:02:43.496
the energy grid like this power

00:02:43.496 --> 00:02:45.231
plant in Kiev.

00:02:45.231 --> 00:02:45.899
Let's bring in now

00:02:45.899 --> 00:02:46.466
Mark Esper,

00:02:46.466 --> 00:02:47.500
the former defense secretary

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:49.202
under President Donald Trump.

00:02:49.202 --> 00:02:50.403
Thank you for joining us, sir.

00:02:50.403 --> 00:02:51.804
The Ukrainian energy minister

00:02:51.804 --> 00:02:54.741
says that Russia used a deal

00:02:54.741 --> 00:02:56.743
using a new tactic in this

00:02:56.743 --> 00:02:58.211
very large scale

00:02:58.211 --> 00:03:01.281
offensive against Ukraine's Ukrainians.

00:03:01.581 --> 00:03:02.282
What does this tell you

00:03:02.282 --> 00:03:03.383
about the strategy right now?

00:03:03.383 --> 00:03:04.851
And they're doing all of these cities.

00:03:04.851 --> 00:03:06.152
They seem to be bombarding them.

00:03:06.152 --> 00:03:07.620
The strategy seems to be ramping up.

00:03:08.922 --> 00:03:09.255
Well, the

00:03:09.255 --> 00:03:10.890
sense is what was

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:12.292
the attack in the last 24?

00:03:12.292 --> 00:03:14.460
48 hours was retribution

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:15.662
for an attack

00:03:15.662 --> 00:03:16.563
allegedly committed

00:03:16.563 --> 00:03:18.631
by the Ukrainians within Russia.

00:03:18.631 --> 00:03:20.800
And so the the Kremlin's response

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:21.334
was to hit them

00:03:21.334 --> 00:03:23.369
hard with 95 plus missiles

00:03:23.369 --> 00:03:25.104
to use a range of ballistic missiles.

00:03:25.104 --> 00:03:27.140
Hypersonic cruise drones.

00:03:27.607 --> 00:03:29.042
And what you find out

00:03:29.042 --> 00:03:30.009
when you dig a little bit deeper

00:03:30.009 --> 00:03:30.677
is that they're actually

00:03:30.677 --> 00:03:32.178
using air defense missiles

00:03:32.178 --> 00:03:34.347
and anti-ship missiles

00:03:34.347 --> 00:03:35.982
to attack Ukraine's infrastructure.

00:03:35.982 --> 00:03:37.951
And it tells you that their stocks

00:03:37.951 --> 00:03:39.886
seem to be fairly depleted.

00:03:39.886 --> 00:03:41.621
Now, kudos to the Ukrainians.

00:03:41.621 --> 00:03:42.722
It looks like their energy

00:03:42.722 --> 00:03:44.824
infrastructure is back on line today.

00:03:44.824 --> 00:03:45.558
And it just shows you

00:03:45.558 --> 00:03:46.893
that it shows you the resilience

00:03:46.893 --> 00:03:47.727
of the Ukrainian people

00:03:47.727 --> 00:03:48.094
when it comes

00:03:48.094 --> 00:03:49.429
to these unwarranted attacks

00:03:49.429 --> 00:03:50.530
on their infrastructure.

00:03:50.530 --> 00:03:51.164
But when it comes

00:03:51.164 --> 00:03:52.465
to these hypersonic missiles

00:03:52.465 --> 00:03:53.132
that they're using,

00:03:53.132 --> 00:03:55.134
you know, they used I think it's six.

00:03:55.134 --> 00:03:55.535
So far

00:03:55.535 --> 00:03:56.369
in this latest attack,

00:03:56.369 --> 00:03:58.471
they have barely used anything like that

00:03:58.471 --> 00:03:59.973
in the entire last year.

00:03:59.973 --> 00:04:00.840
So what does it say to you

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:01.507
that they're ramping up

00:04:01.507 --> 00:04:02.642
hypersonic missiles?

00:04:02.642 --> 00:04:03.910
But also the concern is

00:04:03.910 --> 00:04:05.411
we were talking to John Kerry will say

00:04:05.411 --> 00:04:06.946
Ukraine has nothing

00:04:06.946 --> 00:04:09.382
that can knock those out of the sky.

00:04:09.382 --> 00:04:10.850
Right. Look, they're very hard to defeat.

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:12.752
They travel at five times

00:04:12.752 --> 00:04:14.320
the speed of sound, up to ten times

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:15.054
the speed of sound.

00:04:15.054 --> 00:04:16.923
Very difficult to knock out of the air.

00:04:16.923 --> 00:04:18.224
It's a challenge

00:04:18.224 --> 00:04:19.225
that we in the United States

00:04:19.225 --> 00:04:20.793
military we're looking at as well,

00:04:20.793 --> 00:04:21.995
because we know that China

00:04:21.995 --> 00:04:24.163
is also developing hypersonic weapons.

00:04:24.163 --> 00:04:26.532
So it's going to remain a challenge.

00:04:26.532 --> 00:04:27.634
The fact that they haven't used

00:04:27.634 --> 00:04:29.302
more of them is surprising.

00:04:29.302 --> 00:04:30.270
But this,

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:30.970
again, calls

00:04:30.970 --> 00:04:31.804
for the need to Ukraine

00:04:31.804 --> 00:04:33.606
to get the air defenses it needs.

00:04:33.606 --> 00:04:35.675
I don't think they still have Patriot air

00:04:35.675 --> 00:04:36.576
defense systems,

00:04:36.576 --> 00:04:37.410
not that patriot

00:04:37.410 --> 00:04:39.479
could defeat hypersonics, but still,

00:04:39.579 --> 00:04:40.346
there's much more

00:04:40.346 --> 00:04:41.047
we need to give

00:04:41.047 --> 00:04:42.048
and provide the Ukrainians

00:04:42.048 --> 00:04:42.815
in order to beat back

00:04:42.815 --> 00:04:43.916
the Russian assault.

00:04:43.916 --> 00:04:44.584
Yeah,

00:04:45.151 --> 00:04:45.585
Would that be

00:04:45.585 --> 00:04:46.486
problematic, though,

00:04:46.486 --> 00:04:49.822
for America, for NATO, by giving them

00:04:49.822 --> 00:04:51.257
that, won't they?

00:04:51.391 --> 00:04:51.858
I guess.

00:04:51.858 --> 00:04:52.558
Well, Putin will see it

00:04:52.558 --> 00:04:53.860
as any act of aggression,

00:04:53.860 --> 00:04:55.261
anything that Naito does

00:04:55.261 --> 00:04:57.363
is an act of aggression anyway.

00:04:57.363 --> 00:04:58.298
Well, we've already committed

00:04:58.298 --> 00:04:59.232
to providing patriot.

00:04:59.232 --> 00:04:59.799
We actually have

00:04:59.799 --> 00:05:00.967
Ukrainian soldiers

00:05:00.967 --> 00:05:02.468
reportedly in Oklahoma

00:05:02.468 --> 00:05:03.870
training on the system.

00:05:03.870 --> 00:05:04.904
But it takes time to train.

00:05:04.904 --> 00:05:06.873
It takes time to deliver the systems.

00:05:06.873 --> 00:05:08.141
Another European allies

00:05:08.141 --> 00:05:09.375
providing systems as well.

00:05:09.375 --> 00:05:10.143
But again,

00:05:10.143 --> 00:05:11.311
these are things that the Ukrainians

00:05:11.311 --> 00:05:13.146
were asking for months and months ago.

00:05:13.146 --> 00:05:14.280
And it's a shame that they

00:05:14.280 --> 00:05:15.181
don't have them yet.

00:05:15.181 --> 00:05:17.950
Same goes for tanks and F-16s.

00:05:18.117 --> 00:05:19.485
But on the F-16,

00:05:19.485 --> 00:05:20.353
I'm fascinated by this

00:05:20.353 --> 00:05:21.721
because we are seeing a real split

00:05:21.721 --> 00:05:23.389
between the US and Ukraine on this,

00:05:23.389 --> 00:05:24.791
because President Biden is saying

00:05:24.791 --> 00:05:25.892
they've done the assessment.

00:05:25.892 --> 00:05:27.427
They don't think Ukraine needs them.

00:05:27.427 --> 00:05:28.695
Zelensky is telling, Wolf,

00:05:28.695 --> 00:05:30.296
they could be make or break

00:05:30.296 --> 00:05:31.664
to the outcome of the war

00:05:31.664 --> 00:05:32.198
that they at least

00:05:32.198 --> 00:05:33.333
want to have the Ukrainian pilots

00:05:33.333 --> 00:05:34.233
training on them.

00:05:34.233 --> 00:05:35.435
Is it a mistake for the US

00:05:35.435 --> 00:05:37.570
not to do it, in your view?

00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:38.805
Well, sure it is.

00:05:38.805 --> 00:05:39.138
You know,

00:05:39.138 --> 00:05:40.573
President Biden said a few weeks ago,

00:05:40.573 --> 00:05:42.141
no, no, no, no, no.

00:05:42.141 --> 00:05:44.210
We now understand that Ukrainian pilots

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:45.345
are being evaluated

00:05:45.345 --> 00:05:47.080
here in the United States to do so.

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:47.980
There are also reports

00:05:47.980 --> 00:05:48.948
coming out of the Munich

00:05:48.948 --> 00:05:49.849
Security Conference

00:05:49.849 --> 00:05:50.717
that the United States

00:05:50.717 --> 00:05:52.518
top general in Europe,

00:05:52.518 --> 00:05:53.453
Chris Cavalli,

00:05:53.453 --> 00:05:54.520
the supreme allied commander,

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:55.788
told lawmakers

00:05:55.788 --> 00:05:58.224
that, yes, F-16s would make a difference

00:05:58.224 --> 00:05:58.925
for the Ukrainians.

00:05:58.925 --> 00:06:01.294
And it's obvious they need a platform

00:06:01.661 --> 00:06:02.762
to conduct

00:06:02.762 --> 00:06:03.730
air strikes

00:06:03.730 --> 00:06:06.065
against Russian elements in Ukraine.

00:06:06.265 --> 00:06:07.533
It would very much help

00:06:07.533 --> 00:06:09.001
with our Ukrainian counter-offensive

00:06:09.001 --> 00:06:10.069
that hopefully will be launched

00:06:10.069 --> 00:06:11.504
sometime in the coming months.

00:06:11.504 --> 00:06:11.938
But sure,

00:06:11.938 --> 00:06:12.872
they need advanced fighter

00:06:12.872 --> 00:06:14.107
aircraft Secretary,

00:06:14.107 --> 00:06:15.808
this is something that's very disturbing

00:06:15.808 --> 00:06:16.442
that we're here.

00:06:16.442 --> 00:06:16.976
We're hearing

00:06:16.976 --> 00:06:18.211
coming out of the war,

00:06:18.211 --> 00:06:19.645
we have new reporting here at CNN

00:06:19.645 --> 00:06:21.447
that Russia has been sending

00:06:21.447 --> 00:06:24.684
us weapons captured in Ukraine to Iran.

00:06:25.418 --> 00:06:27.186
How dangerous could that be?

00:06:28.154 --> 00:06:28.454
Well, look,

00:06:28.454 --> 00:06:29.522
first of all, absolutely not

00:06:29.522 --> 00:06:30.857
surprised by this.

00:06:30.857 --> 00:06:32.425
I suspect, frankly, that the Chinese

00:06:32.425 --> 00:06:33.793
have some as well

00:06:33.793 --> 00:06:35.528
because this is what happens in warfare.

00:06:35.528 --> 00:06:37.397
Weapons get left on the battlefield.

00:06:37.397 --> 00:06:39.499
A unit gets overrun, they scoop them up.

00:06:39.499 --> 00:06:40.566
And this becomes

00:06:40.566 --> 00:06:41.701
important intelligence

00:06:41.701 --> 00:06:44.036
collection materials for our adversaries.

00:06:44.036 --> 00:06:46.205
Now, look, the good news is

00:06:46.205 --> 00:06:47.974
these things are hard to re-engineer.

00:06:47.974 --> 00:06:48.574
It's not like you're

00:06:48.574 --> 00:06:49.675
reengineering a peanut butter

00:06:49.675 --> 00:06:50.743
and jelly sandwich.

00:06:50.743 --> 00:06:52.145
And we also build design

00:06:52.145 --> 00:06:54.180
into our systems, anti tampering

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:56.949
and other type of mechanisms to defeat

00:06:57.150 --> 00:06:58.751
anybody trying to take them apart

00:06:58.751 --> 00:06:59.786
and re-engineer them.

00:06:59.786 --> 00:07:01.954
But that said, we you know,

00:07:01.954 --> 00:07:03.356
we should be

00:07:03.356 --> 00:07:05.191
trying to find out what the Iranians have

00:07:05.191 --> 00:07:06.893
and how long it might take to take them

00:07:06.893 --> 00:07:08.261
to get gains, some information

00:07:08.261 --> 00:07:10.363
about how we design our own systems

00:07:10.363 --> 00:07:11.130
and how they might go

00:07:11.130 --> 00:07:12.031
about countering them.

